    "research-layer-without-promotion-status"
  ],
  "next_action": "Run backend coverage and graph-orphan audits against this bridge. Critical unresolved identity or structural collisions block release; research-only gaps remain reportable without pretending they are complete.",
  "route_policy": "Bridge routes are public destinations, not canonical identity. Exact backend record resolution belongs to Explore/registries; graph IDs must never be converted into public URLs by string concatenation."
